roke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>微软设计语言的官方实现，适合做企业办公类应用。</p></blockquote>\n<p>跨平台支持不错，和 <strong>Microsoft 生态结合紧密</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源</th>\n<th>链接</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GitHub</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui\">https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>官网</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://fluentui.dev/\">https://fluentui.dev</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>适合场景</strong>：企业内部系统、Office 风格产品、需要跨平台一致性的项目。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"12-Radix-UI-——-无样式原语的王者\"><a href=\"#12-Radix-UI-——-无样式原语的王者\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"12. Radix UI —— 无样式原语的王者\"></a>12. Radix UI —— 无样式原语的王者</h2><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>几乎是 shadcn&#x2F;ui 的底层基础。</p></blockquote>\n<p>提供高度可访问、无样式的基础组件，让你可以<strong>自由构建自己的设计系统</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源</th>\n<th>链接</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GitHub</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/radix-ui/primitives\">https://github.com/radix-ui/primitives</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>官网</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://radix-ui.com/\">https://radix-ui.com</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>适合场景</strong>：要自建设计系统、对可访问性和灵活性有极高要求的团队。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"按需求推荐\"><a href=\"#按需求推荐\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"按需求推荐\"></a>按需求推荐</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你的需求</th>\n<th>推荐选择</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>新项目 + 想完全掌控</strong></td>\n<td>shadcn&#x2F;ui</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>企业中后台</strong></td>\n<td>Ant Design 或 MUI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>追求视觉冲击</strong></td>\n<td>React Bits + HeroUI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>用 Tailwind，想快速出效果</strong></td>\n<td>daisyUI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>需要全能功能</strong></td>\n<td>Mantine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>自建设计系统</strong></td>\n<td>Radix UI + Headless UI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\"><a href=\"#总结\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"总结\"></a>总结</h2><p>2026 年的组件库已经分化得很明显：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有的帮你<strong>快速出活</strong>（daisyUI、Mantine）</li>\n<li>有的帮你<strong>完全掌控</strong>（shadcn&#x2F;ui、Radix UI）</li>\n<li>有的专门解决<strong>好看的问题</strong>（React Bits、HeroUI）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选对了，能省下大量重复劳动；选错了，后期改起来会很痛苦。</p>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>原文来源：<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xoIrdVzFuRr1YxmpBDRLKA\">前端技术优选</a></p></blockquote>\n","text":"从 shadcn/ui 到 Ant Design，从 React Bits 到 Radix UI——12 个 GitHub 热门组件库横评，按需求推荐...","link":"","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"3.3k","symbolsTime":"3 mins."